ial recognition feature, HoloMon also recognizes the real world.\nIf you nod or make a hand sign, HoloMon will respond to you.\nEnjoy your life with HoloMon.", "short_description": "This is an application to make friends with the mixed reality pet \"HolographicMonster(HoloMon)\".\nThe goal is to live with HoloMon in the real world and raise him to be a big monster.\nYou can give HoloMon food, play with a ball, and so on."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverSquare_1440x1440_1-1.png", "id": "9172328979490389", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570293_9172328986157055_8670910801304381989_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Msv2GSI_O8oQ7kNvwELeZ2w&_nc_oc=Adq_RVjlKuplqzgxVCw20IUsX3923tf6IAhKRuB5OLa545juAfayOaB9xfvO9Of-2k4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXsvhrBlMwUziK6ukr31_LMmarJBqo9WlkGSyEw_MJ1Q&oe=6AFDC0C6"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900_10-3.png", "id": "2288044464904587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982472_2288044468237920_89714264810729936_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gH-c_v9Y1X4Q7kNvwGgBLBg&_nc_oc=Adobe9DSeq82reH-1hVof2-A_yMeDk8dcxfXLDe0G07OGnVMnq5Y0w5qAFcWDEREzbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTP0VKWoOE_cnAYq1O4anOiK3CGH54crKOWOeJ5zqawWQ&oe=6AFDE160"}, {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_16-9.png", "id": "1819020505602835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982637_1819020508936168_3095875184930134309_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_SBzN37Y2SYQ7kNvwH8e8t8&_nc_oc=Ado-k_0Njy-ypP7JiJ4meCJYW-2rkY9jqwrc9Jk5P1I46uTI5TXY_oazPKrQRHVKV5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXiBrXn7qMs_krs9Rz7coRZatB8ras0QRQq6F2PW92mw&oe=6AFDC7D1"}, {